OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACash grants for groups helping
OL,4,Awith money and debt
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations helping people with debt,
OL,7,Fmoney, food and health-related issues
OL,8,Fcan apply for grants of up to #15,000
OL,9,Funder a new #500,000 scheme in Medway.
OL,11,FThe fund, launched by Medway Council,
OL,12,Fis aimed at projects that help
OL,13,Fresidents improve their financial
OL,14,Fwellbeing and avoid, manage and recover
OL,15,Ffrom financial crises.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Vince Maple said the
OL,18,Ffunding was "critically important"
OL,19,Fduring the cost-of-living crisis.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
